WEBVTT

00:00:34.760 --> 00:00:35.700
What is this?

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:37.300
Broccoli.

00:00:37.660 --> 00:00:38.700
Ondonde!

00:00:42.130 --> 00:00:43.300
- Flambe!
- Broccoli!

00:00:43.760 --> 00:00:45.060
Ondonde!

00:00:45.700 --> 00:00:47.830
Be consistent
amongst yourselves!

00:00:55.200 --> 00:00:56.560
Ondonde!

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:04.600
I always, always say unless broccoli
is boiled in the pot, it's too hard to eat!

00:01:06.860 --> 00:01:09.800
Please calm down, Mr. Gargantua!

00:01:16.230 --> 00:01:17.160
Seiren.

00:01:20.030 --> 00:01:22.600
It's not a big deal.

00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:27.860
Big!

00:01:28.960 --> 00:01:32.960
I want to see you but I can't
see you because it hurts so much.

00:01:32.960 --> 00:01:37.060
I'm sure I must
be missing something...

00:01:37.060 --> 00:01:40.300
...and that's why my
prayer hasn't been answered.

00:01:40.300 --> 00:01:44.400
(Yami, the Hat and the Book traveler)
...and that's why my
prayer hasn't been answered.

00:01:44.400 --> 00:01:51.330
I had always believed
that what I saw before me...

00:01:51.660 --> 00:01:58.130
...was the only truth there was.

00:01:58.930 --> 00:02:06.030
But now I know
there isn't just one world.

00:02:06.500 --> 00:02:15.500
There are a thousand worlds called
"if" and I don't know which way to turn.

00:02:17.330 --> 00:02:21.400
I want to see you but
I can't see you; where are you now?

00:02:21.400 --> 00:02:24.530
I'll find you no matter the cost.

00:02:24.730 --> 00:02:32.300
I've wandered into the
labyrinth of your eyes.

00:02:32.300 --> 00:02:36.230
Even if the darkness bars my path...

00:02:36.230 --> 00:02:42.230
...even if my weak heart
is led astray, I won't give up.

00:02:42.230 --> 00:02:47.200
I'll keep searching for you.

00:03:02.630 --> 00:03:07.130
Quill
This is why we still haven't found Eve.

00:03:08.200 --> 00:03:10.200
How many centuries have passed?

00:03:10.760 --> 00:03:18.200
Bro, a hundred...
or two... maybe more?

00:03:18.200 --> 00:03:19.900
Shut your mouth!

00:03:21.830 --> 00:03:23.100
That hurts, bro!

00:03:23.100 --> 00:03:24.060
That's the point!

00:03:25.930 --> 00:03:30.060
Timing is everything
with these sort of things.

00:03:31.500 --> 00:03:34.860
There's only a fine line
between failure and success.

00:03:35.730 --> 00:03:40.930
Still, if it's always a
failure... it makes me angry!

00:03:41.760 --> 00:03:47.160
Don't be so difficult,
they're doing their best.

00:03:48.660 --> 00:03:49.500
K.O.

00:03:49.760 --> 00:03:52.600
You should
recognize their effort...

00:03:53.530 --> 00:04:00.960
...since they possess such a low
mentality and grotesque appearance.

00:04:00.960 --> 00:04:06.700
Also, they're doing the best
they can on such stumpy legs.

00:04:07.900 --> 00:04:10.730
Hey bro... she
tried to compliment us.

00:04:10.730 --> 00:04:14.130
Seiren is really a
nice person after all.

00:04:15.600 --> 00:04:17.700
You call that an effort?

00:04:18.760 --> 00:04:19.400
Yes.

00:04:43.000 --> 00:04:48.730
Well, it's about that time to
travel to another book world.

00:04:49.900 --> 00:04:57.100
In any time period, differences in
culture cause all manner of events.

00:04:58.230 --> 00:05:01.900
Yes, for instance
something like this...

00:05:05.530 --> 00:05:08.100
There's nothing in this place.

00:05:08.930 --> 00:05:11.260
I am bored to death here.

00:05:11.930 --> 00:05:16.400
No TV, no wi fi, no chic bars.

00:05:16.860 --> 00:05:21.230
I doubt if humanity
even exists in this world.

00:05:21.900 --> 00:05:23.200
So, Hatsumi...

00:05:23.730 --> 00:05:29.430
True, I don't even think foreheady
would be out here playing by herself.

00:05:34.060 --> 00:05:37.730
So, this place is 'out' then.

00:05:44.800 --> 00:05:48.660
(barbarian grunts)

00:05:51.460 --> 00:05:53.560
They sure look scary!

00:05:54.160 --> 00:05:56.230
Isn't this supposed to
be the pre-historic era?

00:05:56.230 --> 00:06:00.060
I didn't say that, it was
that fluffy yellow dumpling!

00:06:00.400 --> 00:06:03.630
Bros, let's be nice!

00:06:03.630 --> 00:06:05.860
All humans and
parrots are like family!

00:06:21.460 --> 00:06:22.500
Hazuki!

00:06:24.060 --> 00:06:27.660
Losing your temper rarely works.

00:06:28.560 --> 00:06:31.330
Let's talk to them first.

00:06:31.830 --> 00:06:34.500
Hi, I'm everybody's
favorite, lovable Lilith!

00:06:34.500 --> 00:06:36.160
So nice to meet you all!

00:06:58.960 --> 00:07:00.960
Why do I have to bow?

00:07:02.260 --> 00:07:04.760
See, it worked, didn't it?

00:07:04.760 --> 00:07:06.100
Why?

00:07:06.460 --> 00:07:07.700
That's because...

00:07:09.060 --> 00:07:14.330
...you are the messenger of
the god and the guardian warrior.

00:07:18.360 --> 00:07:23.800
Pardon me, my name is Quill.

00:07:29.630 --> 00:07:33.330
I'm so not happy... so unfair...

00:07:38.530 --> 00:07:41.400
We have prepared
the ride for you, too.

00:07:41.660 --> 00:07:42.460
No thank you.

00:07:46.960 --> 00:07:51.300
Allow me to introduce
myself again, my name is Quill.

00:07:56.860 --> 00:07:59.860
How come you are the only one
who can understand our language?

00:08:01.900 --> 00:08:03.430
I don't know why?

00:08:03.860 --> 00:08:06.400
It must be god's will.

00:08:10.830 --> 00:08:12.260
Birdie!

00:08:12.560 --> 00:08:13.300
What?

00:08:14.360 --> 00:08:16.230
My name is Quill.

00:08:17.000 --> 00:08:18.330
I don't care.

00:08:18.330 --> 00:08:19.600
More importantly, untie me.

00:08:36.000 --> 00:08:37.560
Not bad, not bad!

00:08:39.660 --> 00:08:41.660
I love it!

00:08:47.830 --> 00:08:48.860
Mistress Lilith...

00:08:49.800 --> 00:08:54.260
The village elder is asking about
the prayers for harvest of this year.

00:08:54.730 --> 00:08:55.860
Harvest?

00:08:56.400 --> 00:08:57.730
It'll be alright I guess.

00:09:10.330 --> 00:09:12.830
By the way, what
was your name again?

00:09:13.260 --> 00:09:18.300
Allow me introduce
myself again, my name is Quill.

00:09:31.860 --> 00:09:35.200
I am sorry for losing the flame.

00:09:36.560 --> 00:09:38.560
We'll light it right away.

00:09:44.630 --> 00:09:47.930
Okay everybody,
let's all calm down.

00:09:48.360 --> 00:09:49.730
Mistress Lilith.

00:09:50.860 --> 00:09:53.130
They were around
here somewhere...

00:10:13.330 --> 00:10:15.260
Attention!

00:10:34.130 --> 00:10:37.060
Next, I will make a
vertical stripe handkerchief...

00:10:37.060 --> 00:10:39.060
...into a horizontal striped one!

00:10:46.230 --> 00:10:47.830
Miss warrior!

00:10:49.330 --> 00:10:53.300
Allow me to introduce myself...

00:10:53.900 --> 00:10:55.000
It's Quill, right?

00:11:01.200 --> 00:11:02.460
Where are you going?

00:11:03.560 --> 00:11:04.960
To look for someone.

00:11:05.730 --> 00:11:07.130
That's why I am here.

00:11:08.100 --> 00:11:10.230
Then, I will accompany you.

00:11:10.930 --> 00:11:13.160
Aren't you
supposed to be by Lilith?

00:11:13.360 --> 00:11:16.560
The village people
will take good care of her.

00:11:33.330 --> 00:11:36.760
So, the person you're
looking for is called Hatsumi?

00:11:38.030 --> 00:11:44.500
I'm not sure if she's here
but I must look for her...

00:11:45.930 --> 00:11:47.060
No matter what.

00:11:51.260 --> 00:11:52.730
Miss warrior...

00:11:54.400 --> 00:11:55.460
Miss warrior!

00:12:09.500 --> 00:12:11.660
I greatly admire
your determination.

00:12:12.230 --> 00:12:13.830
I'm sure you'll find her.

00:12:14.860 --> 00:12:15.630
So...

00:12:15.830 --> 00:12:16.960
I wish the best of luck.

00:12:19.460 --> 00:12:20.360
Yeah...

00:13:36.730 --> 00:13:41.200
My dear friends of the woods,
do you remember my name?

00:13:45.830 --> 00:13:49.130
My name is Quill!

00:14:01.100 --> 00:14:02.160
What is that?

00:14:02.160 --> 00:14:04.360
That's a signal
from the village elder.

00:14:04.360 --> 00:14:05.730
He wants us to return soon.

00:14:27.700 --> 00:14:28.700
What?

00:14:28.700 --> 00:14:30.000
You're going to be
sacrificed to Lilith?

00:14:30.000 --> 00:14:30.630
Yes.

00:14:31.060 --> 00:14:34.930
To us, becoming a
sacrifice is the highest honor.

00:14:35.930 --> 00:14:39.930
To be eaten by god's servant.

00:14:40.260 --> 00:14:41.560
To be eaten?

00:14:41.560 --> 00:14:44.100
Yes, to be eaten.

00:14:46.500 --> 00:14:49.800
That way, the
spirit becomes immortal.

00:14:50.400 --> 00:14:51.700
Immortal spirit.

00:14:52.500 --> 00:14:54.800
Wow, that felt good.

00:15:22.660 --> 00:15:26.230
No way, I'm
supposed to eat Quill?

00:16:00.930 --> 00:16:02.100
My name is...

00:16:09.860 --> 00:16:12.030
My name is Quill.

00:16:30.500 --> 00:16:32.700
I am the messenger's...

00:16:37.430 --> 00:16:38.360
...sacrifice.

00:16:44.100 --> 00:16:46.500
My name is Quill.

00:16:47.730 --> 00:16:53.360
Oh great Lilith, the messenger
of the god, please guide me!

00:16:58.300 --> 00:16:59.260
Master warrior...

00:17:01.000 --> 00:17:03.430
I had a great time in the woods.

00:17:09.160 --> 00:17:11.800
I hope you will find Hatsumi.

00:17:25.700 --> 00:17:26.630
Master warrior...

00:17:26.930 --> 00:17:29.060
Lilith is not the
messenger of your god.

00:17:29.900 --> 00:17:31.700
You don't need
to be a sacrifice.

00:17:32.400 --> 00:17:33.460
But...

00:17:34.260 --> 00:17:38.800
Indeed, I can't help
you with your sacrifice.

00:17:39.630 --> 00:17:44.400
I don't know anything
about your eyeball god.

00:18:14.760 --> 00:18:15.630
God?

00:18:52.360 --> 00:18:54.400
Master warrior,
please let me go.

00:18:54.600 --> 00:18:56.400
I must become the sacrifice.

00:18:58.530 --> 00:19:00.460
Why don't you let her go?

00:19:01.130 --> 00:19:03.030
She'll get eaten in front of me!

00:19:03.030 --> 00:19:03.900
It's too disgusting!

00:19:04.700 --> 00:19:06.860
His anger will be calmed
if I become the sacrifice!

00:19:07.630 --> 00:19:09.430
God, my name is...

00:19:45.900 --> 00:19:46.830
God!?

00:19:47.530 --> 00:19:48.800
That wasn't God.

00:19:49.330 --> 00:19:50.400
Just some wild animal.

00:19:51.900 --> 00:19:54.030
Can any animal
transform like that?

00:19:54.560 --> 00:19:56.930
Maybe it was
someone's magic at work?

00:20:01.230 --> 00:20:02.060
He's right.

00:20:02.460 --> 00:20:05.100
We do still need the god.

00:20:12.000 --> 00:20:13.600
That's a brilliant idea!

00:20:14.300 --> 00:20:18.360
The warrior who defeated the
God will become our new God!

00:20:21.400 --> 00:20:25.600
Oh God, my name is Quill!

00:20:26.160 --> 00:20:28.430
Hey, little girl, back off!

00:20:28.860 --> 00:20:31.100
I am not a little girl, my name is...

00:20:31.100 --> 00:20:33.160
It's Quill! Quill! Quill, right!?

00:20:38.230 --> 00:20:44.430
Now, we'll sacrifice the messenger
of the old God to our new God!

00:20:45.460 --> 00:20:46.430
Hazuki!

00:20:46.430 --> 00:20:47.830
Eat me!

00:20:50.200 --> 00:20:52.860
Come on, eat me, eat me!

00:20:57.600 --> 00:20:58.200
Aya?

00:21:00.930 --> 00:21:02.000
You found me...

00:21:02.460 --> 00:21:04.830
How long has he been here?

00:21:15.030 --> 00:21:15.930
Quill?

00:21:16.930 --> 00:21:20.530
We've been tricked again?

00:21:27.630 --> 00:21:29.500
I'm so unhappy.

00:21:29.500 --> 00:21:31.230
This is so unfair.

00:21:45.630 --> 00:21:53.060
I will offer up an eternal prayer.

00:21:53.330 --> 00:21:59.500
I will never give up on what matters.

00:22:02.330 --> 00:22:06.960
I will go there, praying.

00:22:07.530 --> 00:22:13.800
No matter the distance
between us, I will catch you.

00:22:14.060 --> 00:22:21.630
That's a promise between you and I.

00:22:21.830 --> 00:22:28.960
Crying, cradling my memories,...

00:22:28.960 --> 00:22:35.460
..won't help even one
of my feelings to reach you.

00:22:37.060 --> 00:22:44.500
I will offer up an eternal prayer.

00:22:44.700 --> 00:22:51.130
I will never give up on what matters.

00:22:53.100 --> 00:22:59.960
I will find the dawn
between you and I,...

00:23:00.830 --> 00:23:08.460
...and meet the approaching daybreak.

00:23:08.960 --> 00:23:13.700
I will go there, praying.

00:23:14.630 --> 00:23:18.700
Well, Quill was pretty cute but
she clung to Hazuki too much!

00:23:18.700 --> 00:23:19.460
Grumble, grumble!

00:23:19.700 --> 00:23:21.630
Let's take a look at the next book!

00:23:49.330 --> 00:23:50.460
Next Time: Milka

00:23:50.460 --> 00:23:52.460
Next Time: Milka
Yami, the Hat and the Book Traveler.

00:23:53.200 --> 00:23:55.860
Please enjoy the
next story as well.
